<title>CHILE: Telex-Chile 1996 net profit falls.</title>
<headline>Telex-Chile 1996 net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telex-Chile SA, a long-distance telecommunications company, reported the following results for last year.</p>
<p>			     1996	     1995</p>
<p>Net profit		 3.50		profit  6.48</p>
<p>Operating loss	     988 million   profit    516 million</p>
<p>Non-operating profit   4.46		profit  6.20</p>
<p>Revenues		   5.52			 20.03</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in billions of Chilean pesos except where noted.</p>
<p>((-- Roger Atwood, Santiago newsroom +56-2-699-5595 x211))</p>
</text>
